# Next.js + React + Tailwind (3L Moto)

Adapted from PatrickJS/awesome-cursorrules. Project layout uses `app/` and `components/` at repo root (not `/src`).

## Stack
- Next.js App Router, React, TypeScript, Tailwind, shadcn/ui, Supabase
- Do not introduce DaisyUI, Biome, or relocate folders to `/src`

## Code style
- Concise TypeScript; functional components; named exports preferred
- Descriptive names with auxiliaries (`isLoading`, `hasError`)
- Prefer interfaces for object shapes; avoid unnecessary `any`

## UI
- Mobile-first Tailwind; use project design tokens and `module-shell` primitives
- Loading, empty, and error states for data views
- Keep `'use client'` on the smallest interactive leaves when practical

## Performance
- Prefer `next/image`; lazy-load heavy charts/dialogs when useful
- Avoid redundant re-renders in list pages
